<title>USA: Algeria to seek 100,000 tonnes wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria to seek 100,000 tonnes wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is expected this Friday to seek 100,000 tonnes optional origin wheat which would include French, U.S. or Argentine wheat, U.S. exporters said. Shipment was slated for last-half December.</p>
<p>The class of wheat was not given, they said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
